{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37286","headline":"咏手 · 秦韬玉","name":"咏手","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一双十指玉纤纤，不是风流物不拈。\n鸾镜巧梳匀翠黛，画楼闲望擘珠帘。\n金杯有喜轻轻点，银鸭无香旋旋添。\n因把翦刀嫌道冷，泥人呵了弄人髯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"秦韬玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37286.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37286","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}